---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Mascot from '../components/Thomas.astro';
import ThomasDoctor from '../components/ThomasDoctor.astro';
import ThomasAstronaut from '../components/ThomasAstronaut.astro';
import ThomasChef from '../components/ThomasChef.astro';
import ThomasPolice from '../components/ThomasPolice.astro';
import ThomasFirefighter from '../components/ThomasFirefighter.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="ThomOS — Unlock What AI Can Actually Do">

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 1: HERO — The gut punch -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden grid-bg">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-thomos-500/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-claude-400/5 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <div class="mb-8 animate-fade-up">
        <Mascot size="200" class="mx-auto" />
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-display text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tight mb-6 animate-fade-up animate-delay-1">
        Thom<span class="gradient-text">OS</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-4 animate-fade-up animate-delay-2 font-body">
        You already know AI is powerful.<br />
        <span class="text-text-primary font-medium">You just can't reach it.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="text-base text-text-muted max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10 animate-fade-up animate-delay-3">
        ThomOS unlocks what AI can actually do — for strategic professionals who've gone deep enough to know what's missing.
      </p>

      <div class="animate-fade-up animate-delay-4">
        <a href="#waitlist"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-thomos-600 hover:bg-thomos-500 text-white font-medium rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-thomos-500/25 text-lg">
          Request Early Access
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce">
      <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-text-muted" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 2: THE PROBLEM — They'll nod -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-surface-darker">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-thomos-400 font-medium text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Sound Familiar?</p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        You've hit the wall.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl mb-14">
        You've gone deeper with AI than most. You've seen the potential. But you've also felt where it breaks down.
      </p>

      <!-- Pain points — specific, felt -->
      <div class="space-y-6 max-w-2xl">
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="w-1 h-full bg-red-500/20 rounded-full shrink-0 mt-1"></div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
            You've lost a brilliant analysis to a session reset. The thinking, the framing, the connections — gone. You try to recreate it. It's never the same.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="w-1 h-full bg-red-500/20 rounded-full shrink-0 mt-1"></div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
            You've re-explained your project for the fifth time. Same context, same background, same constraints — because the session doesn't remember yesterday.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="w-1 h-full bg-red-500/20 rounded-full shrink-0 mt-1"></div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
            You've watched AI give you a perfect document format — then deliver something completely different next session. The consistency vanishes. The quality drifts.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="w-1 h-full bg-red-500/20 rounded-full shrink-0 mt-1"></div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
            You've tried to use AI for real, sustained work — across weeks, across projects, across domains. And you've realized: <span class="text-text-primary">AI doesn't compound. Every session starts from zero.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-12">
        The constraint was never AI's intelligence. It was the absence of infrastructure around it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 3: VALUE — Before/After -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-surface-dark grid-bg">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-thomos-400 font-medium text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">The Unlock</p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        The constraint was never your thinking.<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">It was organizing around it.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl mb-16">
        That constraint is removed.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Before -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/10 bg-red-500/[0.03]">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-red-300 mb-6">Before</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400/40 shrink-0">&#x2715;</span>
              <span>Every session starts from zero</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400/40 shrink-0">&#x2715;</span>
              <span>AI is a circus act — one trick at a time</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400/40 shrink-0">&#x2715;</span>
              <span>Ideas evaporate between sessions</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400/40 shrink-0">&#x2715;</span>
              <span>You are the integration layer across every project</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- After -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-thomos-500/15 bg-thomos-500/[0.03] glow-blue">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-thomos-300 mb-6">After</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-thomos-400/60 shrink-0">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>Every session builds on the last</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-thomos-400/60 shrink-0">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>AI is your operating system — it manages itself</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-thomos-400/60 shrink-0">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>Every idea captured, every decision tracked, every insight recoverable</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-thomos-400/60 shrink-0">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>Cross-project intelligence — methodology transfers automatically</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 4: TRUST — Proof -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-surface-darker">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-thomos-400 font-medium text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">In Production</p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-16 leading-tight">
        Grown through real work.<br />
        <span class="text-text-muted">Not designed in a lab.</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black gradient-text mb-2">20+</div>
          <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">Projects managed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black gradient-text mb-2">7</div>
          <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">Domains crossed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black gradient-text mb-2">9</div>
          <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">Days to full operational infrastructure</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black gradient-text mb-2">1</div>
          <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">Operator</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card">
        <svg class="absolute top-6 left-6 w-10 h-10 text-thomos-500/20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10H14.017zM0 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151C7.546 6.068 5.983 8.789 5.983 11H10v10H0z" />
        </svg>
        <blockquote class="relative z-10 text-lg md:text-xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed italic pl-8">
          "The constraint was never my ability to analyze, strategize, or execute. It was organizing around the entire effort — the merger, the due diligence, the financial modeling, the stakeholder management, the team development — all at once. That constraint is removed."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="mt-6 text-text-muted text-sm pl-8">
          — One operator. 20+ concurrent projects. 7 domains. Zero prior industry experience in half of them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 5: THOMAS VARIANTS — The cast -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-surface-dark grid-bg">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-thomos-400 font-medium text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">One System. Every Domain.</p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4 leading-tight">
        Same guy. Every role.<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">Always that look.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg mb-16 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        ThomOS works wherever you work. The domain changes. The infrastructure compounds.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6 justify-items-center">
        <div class="text-center">
          <Mascot size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Strategy</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Management at scale</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <ThomasDoctor size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Healthcare</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Domain expansion</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <ThomasAstronaut size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Engineering</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Cross-project intelligence</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <ThomasChef size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Operations</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Compounding output</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <ThomasPolice size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Compliance</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Nothing falls through</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <ThomasFirefighter size="140" />
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-text-primary mt-3">Crisis</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-xs mt-1">Institutional memory</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- SECTION 6: CTA — For the ones who get it -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="waitlist" class="relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-surface-darker overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-thomos-500/8 blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <Mascot size="100" class="mx-auto mb-8" />

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        For strategic professionals<br />who've gone deep enough to hit the wall.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Consultants, COOs, managing partners, advisors. If you manage complexity for a living and you've felt what's missing from AI — this is what's missing.
      </p>

      <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto mb-6">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          class="flex-1 px-5 py-4 bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle rounded-full text-text-primary placeholder-text-muted focus:outline-none focus:border-thomos-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-thomos-500/25 transition-all"
          required
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="px-8 py-4 bg-thomos-600 hover:bg-thomos-500 text-white font-medium rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-thomos-500/25 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Request Early Access
        </button>
      </form>

      <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">
        Limited deployment. We work directly with each early adopter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="py-10 bg-surface-darker border-t border-border-subtle">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-text-primary">ThomOS</span>
        <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">AI Context Management</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-end gap-1">
        <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">
          Powered by <span class="text-thomos-400 font-medium">mPower Insight</span>
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">
          &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Manzano Business Services. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>
